# {{ theme.name }} Theme for delta

{{ theme.name }} Theme for [delta](https://github.com/dandavison/delta), a syntax-highlighting pager for git.

## Prerequisites

This theme uses the {{ theme.name }} bat theme for syntax highlighting. Install the bat theme first:

```bash
# See ../bat/README.md for full instructions
cp ../bat/{{ theme.id }}-{{ first.variant.id }}.tmTheme "$(bat --config-dir)/themes/"
bat cache --build
```

## Installation

1. Copy the theme file to your delta config directory:

   ```bash
   # Create directory if it doesn't exist
   mkdir -p ~/.config/delta

   # Copy the theme{% if variants | length > 1 %} (choose {% for v in variants %}{{ v.variant.id }}{% if not loop.last %} or {% endif %}{% endfor %}){% endif %}
{% for v in variants %}   cp {{ theme.id }}-{{ v.variant.id }}.gitconfig ~/.config/delta/
{% if not loop.last %}   # or
{% endif %}{% endfor %}   ```

2. Include the theme in your `~/.gitconfig`:

   ```gitconfig
   [include]
       path = ~/.config/delta/{{ theme.id }}-{{ first.variant.id }}.gitconfig

   [core]
       pager = delta

   [interactive]
       diffFilter = delta --color-only

   [delta]
       features = {{ theme.id }}-{{ first.variant.id }}
   ```
{% for v in variants | slice(start=1) %}
   Or for {{ v.variant.id }} theme:

   ```gitconfig
   [include]
       path = ~/.config/delta/{{ theme.id }}-{{ v.variant.id }}.gitconfig

   [delta]
       features = {{ theme.id }}-{{ v.variant.id }}
   ```
{% endfor %}
## Alternative: Direct Configuration

You can also copy the settings directly into your `~/.gitconfig`:

```gitconfig
[delta]
    dark = {% if first.variant.appearance == "dark" %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}
    syntax-theme = "{{ theme.name }} {{ first.variant.name }}"
    line-numbers = true
    # ... paste other settings from {{ theme.id }}-{{ first.variant.id }}.gitconfig
```

## Customization

The theme enables `line-numbers` by default. You can add additional options:

```gitconfig
[delta]
    features = {{ theme.id }}-{{ first.variant.id }}
    side-by-side = true          # Enable side-by-side view
    navigate = true              # Use n/N to navigate between files
    hyperlinks = true            # Enable clickable file paths
```

